      },
      "location": "family_home",
      "actors": [
       "me",
       "relative"
      ],
      "priority": 7
     }
    },
    "SHARE": {
     "r": {
      "ko": "단톡방에 간병 당번표가 올라왔다. 다툼도 있었지만, 다들 자기 칸을 채웠다.",
      "en": "A caregiving schedule went up in the family chat. There were fights, but everyone showed up for their shifts."
